ave the day! Hehehe~</i>&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2605 Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 15,000 words in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings: 1 bad ending and 2 good endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what to feed Pippa: the food chosen affects Pippa's magical energy, which will influence the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute character art and cute soundtracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute dogs!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2605 Credits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>story, art, programming:</strong>\u00a0Konayachi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>soundtrack composer:</strong>\u00a0Dalton Attig\u00a0(special thanks to Bristol!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>proofreaders:</strong>\u00a0S.B.Hunter,\u00a0ebi-hime, Wan-chan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>misc. programming help:</strong>\u00a0an anonymous family member</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>sfx:</strong>\u00a0freesfx,\u00a0pixabay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>background art references:</strong>\u00a0pxhere,\u00a0minikle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>tools:\u00a0</strong>ActionEditor3,\u00a0guiManipulate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>other software:</strong>\u00a0Krita,\u00a0VSCodium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>engine:</strong>\u00a0Ren'Py</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This VN is made in a month for\u00a0Spooktober Visual Novel Jam 2024!</p>","developers":["Konayachi"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741640/ab299725d562b84c13066f86c82b4790e3a33338/header.jpg?t=1765216653","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><